1
00:00:02,433 --> 00:00:04,667
Good afternoon, Attorney!

2
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:06,500
Mm! Good afternoon.

3
00:00:07,667 --> 00:00:08,967
Here.

4
00:00:11,167 --> 00:00:13,100
Uh, you just woke up?

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,300
Oh!

6
00:00:14,733 --> 00:00:17,533
No. I've been awake
for a while.

7
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:20,533
I already had our vinegar
delivered earlier.

8
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:23,567
Here, go buy yourself
some clothes.

9
00:00:24,267 --> 00:00:25,633
I still have clothes
back there.

10
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:31,333
If you're going to inherit
Don Nato's 5-billion estate,

11
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,700
you should at least
look presentable.

12
00:00:34,633 --> 00:00:36,200
F-Five billion?!

13
00:00:38,067 --> 00:00:41,500
I'm inheriting five billion?!

14
00:00:42,267 --> 00:00:43,267
You didn't know?

15
00:00:44,467 --> 00:00:46,700
I knew the Roses were wealthy,

16
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,367
but I had no idea
they were that rich.

17
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,367
What did you think?

18
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,667
I thought...

19
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:59,700
it was just enough to buy
a small house for Ima and me.

20
00:01:01,167 --> 00:01:04,400
The kind where we wouldn't
have to turn off the fridge

21
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,667
in the middle of the night...

22
00:01:07,033 --> 00:01:08,767
just to save on electricity.

23
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:13,400
The kind where she wouldn't
have to walk all the way

24
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:18,767
to the market just
to save on transportation.

25
00:01:19,733 --> 00:01:21,767
Just something like that.

26
00:01:24,767 --> 00:01:26,167
Go buy what you need.

27
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,300
I don't want you
buying me anything--

28
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:29,700
[PING] It's a corporate card.

29
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:32,767
So technically, everything
you spend with it is your money.

30
00:01:34,633 --> 00:01:35,733
Just take it.

31
00:01:36,833 --> 00:01:43,800
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

32
00:01:44,767 --> 00:01:46,133
Thank you.

33
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:54,533
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

34
00:01:55,333 --> 00:01:57,833
Oh, are you surprised
she didn't know?

35
00:01:58,833 --> 00:02:00,533
Everything about June
is surprising.

36
00:02:01,333 --> 00:02:03,733
All she's ever wanted is for
her mom to live comfortably

37
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:06,333
and to help her family.

38
00:02:07,133 --> 00:02:10,400
She is one of a kind.
[CHUCKLES]

39
00:02:11,167 --> 00:02:13,167
In the end, it looks like
Don Nato was right

40
00:02:13,167 --> 00:02:14,733
to have the two of you
get married.

41
00:02:14,767 --> 00:02:21,700
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

42
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:43,367
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]
